Files in this repository that derive from Cycles say so in a header comment naming the Cycles source file they were ported from. Parts of Cycles' microfacet code are themselves adapted from Open Shading Language (Copyright 2009-2010 Sony Pictures Imageworks Inc., et al., BSD-3-Clause), and are marked where they are ported.

The precomputed BSDF energy-compensation tables (Cycles' src/scene/shader.tables) are not stored in this repository: scripts/fetch-tables.mjs downloads them from the Cycles repository at a pinned commit, checks their SHA-256, and embeds them in the build.
